Subject: [PATCH] New Patch Level for android mainline

new android.bp file to define android-mainline patch level
xml to define the patch level 2.

Bug: 433787201
(cherry picked from https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:fa11a4437b6a5d41d503fac3763ed0d17e5adeff)
